{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "4e54b894231c975d04d57db695bd7f0aee3a00010e19c996771d38253713d607", "ja": "夢をくれた言葉", "zh": "赋予梦想的话语", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6e255f7045a2f44b420b2641fc2619c26f771080b8fd2b8cfb591447ae451c94", "ja": "ライブ開演を控え、このみに感謝を伝える\nプロデューサー。このみはプロデューサー\nからは勇気をもらったと返す。\nスカウトの時のプロデューサーの言葉は、\n今も、これからもこのみを輝かせていく。", "zh": "演出即将开场，制作人向可奈美表达感谢。  \n可奈美则回应说，自己从制作人那里获得了勇气。  \n制作人在发掘她时说过的话，  \n如今以及今后，也会一直让可奈美绽放光彩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c495b107c5216d248d9dc19e108953f79de5052284b5ba9f9c65a3beac0d9f2e", "ja": "ライブ開演直前……", "zh": "演出开始前一刻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "734b053f2d2874db772058612c69fe011a8290ee5049dd8ffa586500021bd889", "ja": "プロデューサー、大丈夫なの？\n開演が少し遅れるって聞いたけど……。", "zh": "制作人，没事吧？\n我听说开场要稍微晚一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "c90cbbe570bc8ead0fdcd7e1f786c9b7efbd9cc760069dc8eda7fe001c0e200b", "ja": "すみません、客入れに少し時間がかかって。\nでも、もう問題なく進行してますから。大丈夫です！", "zh": "不好意思，观众入场花了点时间。\n不过现在已经顺利进行中了，没问题的！放心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "7af0e392e245ca695dbb0febf99865899f1dcf1f671fec92e558459ea6d6137d", "ja": "そう、よかった。今度こそ無事に、\nメインステージでライブができそうね♪", "zh": "那就好。这次应该能顺利在主舞台上进行演出了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "6a7d8d53adc65a434481050cf45d4aa3c5e406f355356d3cb1f4125d1a27ed31", "ja": "劇場の年長者として、チームのお姉さんとして、\n発揮すべきはこの溢れ出るセクシー……！", "zh": "作为剧场里的前辈、队伍里的姐姐，\n现在该展现的，就是这满溢而出的性感……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "8037f6fde0fbedaf05c73487808b4d53b3cfc45778099eef6482ec7b9b98250d", "ja": "いよいよこのみお姉さんのアダルティな魅力を、\nライブで振りまくわよ！　ウフフ♪", "zh": "终于要在演出中展现出\n木实姐姐大人的魅力啦！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "d9189bceab88db6f22a2f8298edb78d1495729164e849777d329db36b2baeec8", "ja": "……頼もしいです。このみさんの魅力、\nたくさんの人に伝えましょう！", "zh": "……真靠得住。把木实小姐的魅力，\n传达给更多的人吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "5298547c36f3baa3f6331a6d96b5694f2b316ebf67217a996d9c32386fed2b92", "ja": "ええ！　……いざとなると、こんな舞台に自分が立つ\nなんて、夢みたいに感じちゃうけど……。", "zh": "是啊！……真到了这一刻，觉得自己竟然能站在这样的舞台上，简直像做梦一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "1ef847174273f87123c0eb704ffc64420eb5b13e2421a4f52505c115cd340938", "ja": "でも、夢じゃないのね。", "zh": "不过，这不是梦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "6baa0a9e3d35f6a4b6ff075c5968c149286927743972c82989e4ca2b09ae4707", "ja": "はい。それに、今回だけでもないです。", "zh": "是的。而且，也不只是这一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "742dda880c22e9fa0be0c923f9a13de67c51043568509c3e779c35b0276a3dd2", "ja": "このみさんには、この先何度も！\nたくさんの舞台に立ってもらいますからね！", "zh": "今后还会让好几次登上许多舞台呢，木实小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "277b2a17a57c5cac6b0a0c786327042098c3cf6ff62c48d07c27750f9f1772d1", "ja": "……あら。なんだか今日は、\nプロデューサーの方が張り切ってない？", "zh": "……哎呀。怎么感觉今天，\n制作人反而更有干劲呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "8a6f45930c6b2ed61eef7e93ae72ca39ea7d8702e381b5a205af5e5aca9cb91e", "ja": "あ、すみません。力みすぎですかね……？\n俺も、今度こそっていう思いはどうしてもあって……。", "zh": "啊，不好意思。是我太使劲了吗……？\n我也确实忍不住想着，这次一定要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "af49e75a3c3e9ecc2b957865f90c8a7cd775a1b1c03ad4cc821026919952a6e2", "ja": "デビューイベントの時は、このみさんに頼り切り\nでしたから。今日こそ、そばでしっかり支えて……。", "zh": "出道活动时，我几乎全靠木实姐帮忙。所以今天，我一定要在她身边好好支持她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "b46d0ab0cc8992ab2f6d60080042cbfa84368b71e2b17b508b14c0182b8742ab", "ja": "この目で見届けたいんです。\nこのみさんが、ステージで輝く姿を。", "zh": "我想亲眼见证，\n亲眼看着这美小姐在舞台上闪耀的身姿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "315b2b7c86a637286cdce4179da21bf3e7f79061cd356195a2656549d49e7b3f", "ja": "もう、デビューイベントのこと、まだ気にしてたの？\n確かに、トラブルが起きて大変だったけど。", "zh": "真是的，出道活动的事情你还在介意吗？\n当时确实遇到了突发状况，挺不容易的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "0fcc2375bd307d0aaca571f067fdc646c0525bb2ac1bb7cc11f0c77b53e5d9b4", "ja": "でも、私に勇気をくれたじゃない。\nあの時も……。初めて出会った時も。", "zh": "可是，你不是给了我勇气吗？\n那时候也是……第一次见面的时候也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1019_staff", "source_sha256": "e9692e77364dd3db39b3ceda318cbc759dbc110363eeb96af566f0a735d4cf40", "ja": "会場準備、OKです！\nみなさん、よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "会场准备，OK！\n大家，拜托啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "4f9fa1e6e1d895b5e02b10ee81563a106ab832b7fb1fb469ef891029170b5a8f", "ja": "あっ、準備できたみたいね。\nいよいよ本番……。", "zh": "啊，看来已经准备好了。\n终于要正式开始了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "d4441c0ed6854b3c2200fbd6e386669bc5631caaee4460ce798a5c699c486747", "ja": "ねえ、プロデューサー。私をアイドルに誘って\nくれた時、自分がなんて言ったか、覚えてる？", "zh": "制作人，你还记得当初邀请我成为偶像时，自己说了些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "a5b6064ddf991d45d70f34e3795d1abb437771f75c4b74429867936811871c08", "ja": "え、俺がですか！？　ええと……！\nきゅ、給料のこととか……？", "zh": "咦，是我吗！？呃……！\n难、难道是工资之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "da35c96c072a8ae736ba27241adb31e4caaa0f1d380ab57532d835a1e28939d3", "ja": "違うわよ！　覚えてないならいいの。\nそれじゃ、いってくるわね。", "zh": "不是啦！想不起来就算了。那我先走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "e87b5e0a77050ff654b82af93cc280ca4530779fa22a98bda265fca17cdbf947", "ja": "は、はい……いや、すみません！\nちゃんと思い出しておきますから！　ええっと……！", "zh": "好、好的……不，对不起！我会好好记住的！呃……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "9e4cbc7a14270d7c866d3d676d175aa8f2e75077739a17234391633106d74aa2", "ja": "いいんだってば！\n今日はもう言ってもらえたから。", "zh": "都说了没关系的啦！\n毕竟今天你已经对我说过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710", "ja": "へ？", "zh": "耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "cdab9ed1312e9a9acbda38bea04ec02a0d0e3e77a6ca406a7c867467d0f48bb5", "ja": "しっかり見届けてちょうだい。\nステージで拍手を浴びて、最高に輝く……。", "zh": "一定要好好见证哦。\n在舞台上赢得掌声，绽放出最耀眼的光芒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_06_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "951893ab72681c0f849af842190c7540bc7489f1f418db45ee0d46faca66b60b", "ja": "アイドルの、私のこと！", "zh": "偶像的我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
